ticket: 004
title: Digest cadence and unsubscribe granularity
type: grilling
status: open
blocked_by: [003]
claimed_by:
claimed_at:
---

## Question

For the later email digest: what is its send cadence and cutoff (fixed
wall-clock hour per user timezone, rolling 24h, or user-chosen), what happens
on a day with zero notifications (skip vs send an empty digest), and at what
granularity can a user unsubscribe from the digest — all-or-nothing, or
per-event-type in line with the in-app preference model?

Blocked on [003 — Preference model shape](003-preference-model.md): digest
opt-out granularity cannot be settled before the preference model's shape is
decided, since a per-event-type digest opt-out only exists if the preference
model is per-event-type.
```

